{"id": "EUVD-2026-83454", "enisaUuid": "019ae744-76f5-3b09-9f7f-c47b4d44bc57", "description": "A flaw was found in the OpenShift console. Unauthenticated access to the `/api/devfile/` and `/api/devfile/samples/` endpoints allows a remote attacker to send crafted devfile payloads. This can lead to Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF), where the console pod makes requests to internal services and reflects partial responses to the attacker. Additionally, by sending repeated large requests without a specified content length, an attacker can cause unbounded memory growth, leading to a Denial of Service (DoS).", "datePublished": "2026-09-18T21:58:11", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T05:10:34", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:L", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70587", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70617", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70647", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:71447", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:71450", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:71453", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:71454", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:73853", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:73869", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:77321", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82813", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-75885", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2517885"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hm52-6738-r26p", "CVE-2026-75885"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.82, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "07ee3a3a-192e-3b1e-b840-994ce35fa575", "product": {"name": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform 4.19", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1790095950"}, {"id": "0894c101-7d69-3120-8f01-3c70821c3de0", "product": {"name": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform 4.21", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1790142788"}, {"id": "1a86770a-6b